      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201100904/2011009040050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、\r\n家内安全、学業成就、合格祈願……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……樹里はなんのお守りが欲しいんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009040060,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "え、あー……いや……\r\nこれってのは、決めてなくて……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100904/2011009040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009040070,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……ユニットのみんなに、\r\n今年も仕事を頑張れるようにって、渡したくてさ……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100904/2011009040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……はは\r\nそういうことか、優しいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009040080,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……わ、笑ってんじゃねーよ……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
