  },
  {
    "id": 2011009040260,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "アタシとアンタが思う成功も違うだろうし……\r\nユニットのみんなが思う成功も違うはずだろ？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100904/2011009040260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009040270,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "──っていうか、アタシは自分の成功ってのも、\r\nどんなのか想像つかねーし……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100904/2011009040270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009040280,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "でもまあ、きっと全員分の成功の形、届けてくれんだろ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100904/2011009040280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな\r\nきっと神様も、そのあたり臨機応変に対応してくれるはずだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009040290,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "はは、\r\n臨機応変な神様ってなんだよ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100904/2011009040290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……\r\n──ああでも、みんなの成功の形は違うけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺の成功は、樹里が樹里の成功を達成することだからな\r\nだから、樹里と俺のは同じだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009040300,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……じゃ、アタシとプロデューサーのふたり分、\r\nお守りに頑張ってもらうか",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
